    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In October, 12 students from Simon Fraser University (SFU) based in Canada, travelled to Aga Khan University's \n       Arusha Climate and Environmental Research Centre  (AKU-ACER) in Arusha, Tanzania. They are the first cohort of an inaugural field school to investigate educational issues related to the development of human awareness and understanding of the environment.",
